<doc id="76406" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=76406" title="Dina Mariana">
Dina Mariana

Dina Mariana Heuvelman (#ALIH). Dina Mariana iku salah sijiné penyanyi lan juru main filem kang asalé saka &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt;. Dina Mariana kalebu penyanyi éra &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; 70 lan 80-an.
<h2>Karir</h2>
Karir.
Dina misuwur dadi penyanyi cilik nalika taun 70-an bareng karo &lt;a href="Adi%20Bing%20Slamet"&gt;Adi Bing Slamet&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ira%20Maya%20Sopha"&gt;Ira Maya Sopha&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Diana%20Papilaya"&gt;Diana Papilaya&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Nourma%20Yunita"&gt;Nourma Yunita&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sari%20Yok%20Koeswoyo"&gt;Sari Yok Koeswoyo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Iyut%20Bing%20Slamet"&gt;Iyut Bing Slamet&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Chicha%20Koeswoyo"&gt;Chicha Koeswoyo&lt;/a&gt;. Dina Mariana uga isih diarani dadi mantan penyanyi cilik sanajan tau nggawé hits dadi penyanyi remaja kanthi lagu kang judhulé "Ingat Kamu" ing akir taun 1980-an. Nalika duwé karir, Dina wis ngasilaké album kang cacahé &lt;a href="55"&gt;55&lt;/a&gt; album lan dadi bintang ing &lt;a href="21"&gt;21&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; layar amba, 1 &lt;a href="sin%C3%A9tron"&gt;sinétron&lt;/a&gt; sèri &lt;a href="26"&gt;26&lt;/a&gt; épisode, lan 3 sinétron lepas.
Nalika Ramelan 1428 H ing sasi &lt;a href="September"&gt;September&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt;, Dina nggawé &lt;a href="album"&gt;album&lt;/a&gt; kang judhule "12 Kumpulan Lagu Anak Indonesia", kanthi hits "Jalan Menuju Allah" anggitané &lt;a href="AT%20Mahmud"&gt;AT Mahmud&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Kauripan pribadi</h2>
Kauripan pribadi.
Dina Mariana palakrama karo &lt;a href="Radian%20Ratulangi%20Sugandi"&gt;Radian Ratulangi Sugandi&lt;/a&gt;. Saka pernikahané iki, Dina éntuk anak kang cacahé telu ya iku &lt;a href="Ezra%20Mandira%20Sugandi"&gt;Ezra Mandira Sugandi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ewaldo%20Andipo%20Sugandi"&gt;Ewaldo Andipo Sugandi&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Elyshia%20Nashira%20Ramandina%20Sugandi"&gt;Elyshia Nashira Ramandina Sugandi&lt;/a&gt;.
