<doc id="76542" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=76542" title="Andhara Early">
Andhara Early

Andhara Early Astrawinata (#ALIH). Andhara Early ya iku salah sijiné &lt;a href="presenter"&gt;presenter&lt;/a&gt; acara &lt;a href="Televisi"&gt;TV&lt;/a&gt;.
Andhara Early lair saka pasangan &lt;a href="Adilwan%20Astrawinata"&gt;Adilwan Astrawinata&lt;/a&gt; (bapak) lan &lt;a href="Narwila%20Narang"&gt;Narwila Narang&lt;/a&gt; (ibu). Andhara Early anak pambarep saka sadulur kang cacahé papat. Seduluré nduwéni jeneng &lt;a href="Ariaputra%20Emir%20Astrawinata"&gt;Ariaputra Emir Astrawinata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Adindari%20Edvinari%20Astrawinata"&gt;Adindari Edvinari Astrawinata&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Alifputra%20Etienne%20Astrawinata"&gt;Alifputra Etienne Astrawinata&lt;/a&gt;. Sawisé nikah karo ibuné, bapaké banjur nikah manèh karo wong wadon kang jenengé &lt;a href="Nourma%20Yunita"&gt;Nourma Yunita&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Karir</h2>
Karir.
Andhara Early tau dadi runner up lan pemenang favorit &lt;a href="GADIS%20Sampul"&gt;GADIS Sampul&lt;/a&gt; 1995. Sadurungé tampil dadi modhel sampul &lt;a href="Majalah"&gt;Majalah&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Playboy"&gt;Playboy Indonesia&lt;/a&gt; édisi perdana nalika tanggal &lt;a href="7%20April"&gt;7 April&lt;/a&gt; 2006, Andhara Early uga tau tampil dadi iklan Mi Sedaap, Goldmart, lan H&amp;R. Saliyané modhél iklan Andhara Early uga tau akting filem. &lt;a href="Film"&gt;Film&lt;/a&gt; kang tau dibintangi Andhara Early ya iku filem kang judhule Rumah Ketujuh lan Badan Pasti Berlalu kang disiyaraké lumantar tivi. Saliyané akting filem, Andhara Early uga akting ing &lt;a href="sin%C3%A9tron"&gt;sinétron&lt;/a&gt;. sinétron kang dibintangi Early kayata Dunia Tanpa Koma, Selebriti juga Manusia, Lupus Milenia II, Vanya, Bekisar Merah, lan Perayaan Besar.
Andhara Early uga dadi presenter ing acara By Request (&lt;a href="SCTV"&gt;SCTV&lt;/a&gt;), Pista (&lt;a href="Indosiar"&gt;Indosiar&lt;/a&gt;), LatiNight (&lt;a href="MetroTV"&gt;MetroTV&lt;/a&gt;), Espresso (&lt;a href="ANTV"&gt;ANTV&lt;/a&gt;), Gelar Panco (&lt;a href="Indosiar"&gt;Indosiar&lt;/a&gt;), dan MTV Campus (&lt;a href="MTV"&gt;MTV&lt;/a&gt;).
<h2>Kauripan pribadi</h2>
Kauripan pribadi.
