McCartney misuwur amargi dados satunggalipun personil &lt;a href="The%20Beatles"&gt;The Beatles&lt;/a&gt;, kaliyan &lt;a href="John%20Lennon"&gt;John Lennon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="George%20Harrison"&gt;George Harrison&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Ringo%20Starr"&gt;Ringo Starr&lt;/a&gt;. McCartney lan John Lennon dados musisi ingkang populer ing sajarah &lt;a href="musik"&gt;musik&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="rock"&gt;rock&lt;/a&gt;. Sasampunipun medal saking grup &lt;a href="The%20Beatles"&gt;The Beatles&lt;/a&gt;, McCartney dados solo karier lan mlebet grup band Wings kaliyan garwanipun, &lt;a href="Linda%20McCartney"&gt;Linda Eastman&lt;/a&gt; lan musisi &lt;a href="Denny%20Laine"&gt;Denny Laine&lt;/a&gt;.
&lt;a href="BBC%20News"&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt; Online nyerat namanipun McCartney minangka "greatest composer of the millennium" (komposer paling ageng ing abad milenium). BBC News ugi nyerat bilih lagu The Beatles "&lt;a href="Yesterday%20%28song%29"&gt;Yesterday&lt;/a&gt;" dados satunggalipun lagu ingkang suksès piyambak sadangunipun rekaman ngalahaken 2.200 &lt;a href="artis"&gt;artis&lt;/a&gt; wiwit dipunrilis ing taun &lt;a href="1965"&gt;1965&lt;/a&gt;. Lagu punika sampun dipunsetèl ngantos 7.000.000 ing &lt;a href="televisi"&gt;televisi&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="radio"&gt;radio&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;.
