Ressa Herlambang

<ol>
<li>ALIH</<li>
</ol>
Ressa Herlambang (#ALIH). Ressa Herlambang iku penyanyi kang asalé saka &lt;a href="Indonesia"&gt;Indonesia&lt;/a&gt;. Ressa Herlambang tau pacaran karo &lt;a href="Nia%20Ramadhani"&gt;Nia Ramadhani&lt;/a&gt; kang saiki dadi bojoné &lt;a href="Ardi%20Bakrie"&gt;Ardi Bakrie&lt;/a&gt;. Ressa Herlambang tau diarani &lt;a href="Justin%20Timberlake"&gt;Justin Timberlake&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Indonesia"&gt;Indonesia&lt;/a&gt;. Ressa Herlambang tau éntuk jejuluk dadi penyanyi &lt;a href="R%26amp%3BB"&gt;R&amp;B&lt;/a&gt; lanang kang paling apik saéngga Ressa tau lumebu ing ajang &lt;a href="musik"&gt;musik&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Asia%20Bagus"&gt;Asia Bagus&lt;/a&gt; nalika &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1999"&gt;1999&lt;/a&gt;. Ressa Herlambang pancen nduwéni niyat kanggo ngembangaké karir ing donyaning musik. Nganti saiki, Ressa wis nggawe album kang cacahé telu.
Ressa Herlambang iku anak pambarep saka sadulur kang cacahé telu. Album kang nomer telu kang digawé judhulé The Real Me. Ing album iki Ressa uga tetep nganggo aliran musik R&amp;B. Saliyané iku, Ressa uga nggaet &lt;a href="musisi"&gt;musisi&lt;/a&gt; handal kaya ta &lt;a href="Jocky%20Soeryoprayogo"&gt;Jocky Soeryoprayogo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tohpati"&gt;Tohpati&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pay"&gt;Pay&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="BIP"&gt;BIP&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Dewiq%2C"&gt;Dewiq,&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Iwang%20Noorsaid"&gt;Iwang Noorsaid&lt;/a&gt; nalika nggawé &lt;a href="album"&gt;album&lt;/a&gt; kang kaping telu iki. Musisi-musisi iki kalebu musisi senior ing &lt;a href="Indonesia"&gt;Indonesia&lt;/a&gt;. Ressa herlambang duwé &lt;a href="zodiak"&gt;zodiak&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="aries"&gt;aries&lt;/a&gt; lan duwé &lt;a href="shio"&gt;shio&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Kerbau%20%28shio%29"&gt;Kerbau&lt;/a&gt;.
Saliyané nyanyi, Ressa uga tau nggawé acara kang judhulé Dance With Me. Ing acara iki, Ressa bakal milih penari kang cacahé sepuluh kang bakal &lt;a href="nari"&gt;nari&lt;/a&gt; karo Ressa. Tanggal &lt;a href="16"&gt;16&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Juni"&gt;Juni&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2008"&gt;2008&lt;/a&gt;, Ressa tunangan karo bocah wadon kang umuré &lt;a href="18"&gt;18&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; ya iku &lt;a href="Andhisa%20Putri%20Raharjo"&gt;Andhisa Putri Raharjo&lt;/a&gt;.
