Giganotosaurus

Giganotosaurus (]) ya iku siji jinis &lt;a href="dinosaurus"&gt;dinosaurus&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="carchadontosaurid"&gt;carchadontosaurid&lt;/a&gt; sing urip sawatara 97 taun kepengker sadawané jaman awal tahap &lt;a href="Cenomanian"&gt;Cenomanian&lt;/a&gt; saka akir &lt;a href="periode"&gt;periode&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Cretaceous"&gt;Cretaceous&lt;/a&gt;. Dinosaurus iki tinepang minangka salah sijining dinosaurus &lt;a href="karnivora"&gt;karnivora&lt;/a&gt; gedhé dhéwé ing antarané karnivora liyané. Ukurane luwih gedhé adoh saka &lt;a href="Tyrannosaurus%20rex"&gt;Tyrannosaurus rex&lt;/a&gt;,nanging luwih cilik tinimbang &lt;a href="Spinosaurus"&gt;Spinosaurus&lt;/a&gt;. Fosile tinemu ing nagara &lt;a href="Argentina"&gt;Argentina&lt;/a&gt;.
