Dewiq wiwit ngerti musik lan wiwit seneng &lt;a href="musik"&gt;musik&lt;/a&gt; kang duwé aliran &lt;a href="rock"&gt;rock&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Gun%20n%20Rose"&gt;Gun n Rose&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Black%20sabath"&gt;Black sabath&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Metalica"&gt;Metalica&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika &lt;a href="kuliyah"&gt;kuliyah&lt;/a&gt; jurusan &lt;a href="Sastra%20Inggris"&gt;Sastra Inggris&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="STIBA"&gt;STIBA&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Bandung"&gt;Bandung&lt;/a&gt;, Dewiq nggawé &lt;a href="grup%20band"&gt;grup band&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Red%20Rose"&gt;Red Rose&lt;/a&gt; kang mirunggan main musik &lt;a href="Extreme"&gt;Extreme&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mr%20Big"&gt;Mr Big&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Led%20Zeppelin"&gt;Led Zeppelin&lt;/a&gt;. Nanging saking senengé ngeband lan mèlu &lt;a href="festival"&gt;festival&lt;/a&gt;-festival musik ndadékaké kuliyahé ora nutug lan mung tekan &lt;a href="semester"&gt;semester&lt;/a&gt; papat.
Dewiq wiwit pacaran karo &lt;a href="Pay"&gt;Pay&lt;/a&gt; nalika lagi nggawé &lt;a href="album"&gt;album&lt;/a&gt; kang kaping pindho. Sasi &lt;a href="Maret"&gt;Maret&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2001"&gt;2001&lt;/a&gt;, Dewiq lan Pay banjur nikah. Leloroné cerai nalika taun &lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt;.
