Helmalia Putri (#ALIH. Helmalia biyasa diundang kanthi jeneng Puput utawa Putri. Helmalia iku salah sijiné juru main &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; wadon kang asalé saka Indonésia. Helmalia nduwé awak kang dhuwuré &lt;a href="170"&gt;170&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="cm"&gt;cm&lt;/a&gt;. Helmalia ngugemi &lt;a href="agama"&gt;agama&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Islam"&gt;Islam&lt;/a&gt;.
Artis iki dadi anak kang nomer loro saka pasangan &lt;a href="Helmi%20Yusuf"&gt;Helmi Yusuf&lt;/a&gt; (alm.) lan &lt;a href="Esmaliawati"&gt;Esmaliawati&lt;/a&gt;. Helmalia iku alumnus saka &lt;a href="SMA%20Negeri%2045%20Jakarta"&gt;SMA Negeri 45 Jakarta&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Karir</h2>
Karir.
Puput tau main ing &lt;a href="sin%C3%A9tron"&gt;sinétron&lt;/a&gt; kang judhulé Melodi Cinta, Melodi Cinta 3, Cinta Berkalang Noda 2, Semau Gue, Kafir, Satu Mawar Tiga Duri, Kuingin Kau Mencintaiku, Hidayah, Lindungi TitipanMU. Saliyané main sinétron, Puput uga main layar lebar. &lt;a href="Film"&gt;Film&lt;/a&gt; layar lebar kang tau dibintangi ya iku filem kang judhulé Reinkarnasi.
<h2>Kauripan pribadi</h2>
Kauripan pribadi.
Puput isih nduwéni katurunan &lt;a href="Ac%C3%A8h"&gt;Acèh&lt;/a&gt; saka wong tuwané. Helmalia Putri iku mantan pacar saka aktor &lt;a href="Indra%20Bruggman"&gt;Indra Bruggman&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Okan%20Kornelius"&gt;Okan Kornelius&lt;/a&gt; lan metalik &lt;a href="Deddy%20Corbuzier"&gt;Deddy Corbuzier&lt;/a&gt;. Saliyané iku, Helmalia Putri uga tau dikabaraké nduwéni gayutan karo juru main filem kang asalé saka &lt;a href="Malaysia"&gt;Malaysia&lt;/a&gt;. Artis Malaysia iki jenengé &lt;a href="Arash%20Muhammad"&gt;Arash Muhammad&lt;/a&gt;. Iki kadadéan amarga nalika iku Helmalia Putri lagi &lt;a href="syuting"&gt;syuting&lt;/a&gt; filem Malaysia kang judhulé Istri Ceo ing &lt;a href="nagari%20Jiran"&gt;nagari Jiran&lt;/a&gt; iku.
