Shenny Andrea (#ALIH), iku salah sijiné juru main sinétron lan bintang filem kang asalé saka &lt;a href="Indonesia"&gt;Indonesia&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Karir</h2>
Karir.
Shenny Andrea miwiti karir dadi pameran pambiyantu ing &lt;a href="sin%C3%A9tron"&gt;sinétron&lt;/a&gt;-sinétron kaya ta sinétron akng judhulé Permataku, Wajah Penuh Cinta, Panji Manusia Millenium, Keajaiban, Basa Bibir, Wah!!! Cantiknya …?, Wah!!! Cantikanya … 2, Ikhlas, lan Dia. Sanajan durung tau dadi pameran utama ing sinétron, nanging Shenny éntuk tawaran kanggo main ing &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; layar amba prodhuksi &lt;a href="Creative%20Motion%20Pictures"&gt;Creative Motion Pictures&lt;/a&gt;. Film iki di&lt;a href="prodhuser"&gt;prodhuser&lt;/a&gt;i karo &lt;a href="Asun%20Mawardi"&gt;Asun Mawardi&lt;/a&gt; saka Indonésia. Film iki duwé tema The Black Magic (2003). Jenengé kang mauné &lt;a href="Shenny%20Andriani"&gt;Shenny Andriani&lt;/a&gt; banjur ganti dadi Shenny Andrea. Shenny dadi siji-sijiné pameran utama kang asalé saka Indonesia. Déné juru main-juru main liyané asalé saka &lt;a href="Hollywood"&gt;Hollywood&lt;/a&gt; kaya ta &lt;a href="Guy%20Bracca"&gt;Guy Bracca&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Christina%20Wieber"&gt;Christina Wieber&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Daniel%20Lennox"&gt;Daniel Lennox&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Brian%20Bianchini"&gt;Brian Bianchini&lt;/a&gt;.
&lt;a href="Taun"&gt;Taun&lt;/a&gt; 2007, Shenny Andrea uga mèlu main ing filem Diva, filem iki digawé karo telu kultur pafileman saka telung nagara. &lt;a href="Aktor"&gt;Aktor&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Aktris"&gt;Aktris&lt;/a&gt; asalé saka &lt;a href="Malaysia"&gt;Malaysia&lt;/a&gt; lan Indonesia. Déné &lt;a href="sutradara"&gt;sutradara&lt;/a&gt;né lan kru tèknis asalé saka &lt;a href="India"&gt;India&lt;/a&gt;. Film iki dibintangi &lt;a href="Ning%20Baizura"&gt;Ning Baizura&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Balkisyh"&gt;Balkisyh&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Awal%20Ashari"&gt;Awal Ashari&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Adam%20AF2"&gt;Adam AF2&lt;/a&gt; saka Malaysia, lan &lt;a href="Jeremy%20Thomas"&gt;Jeremy Thomas&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jessica%20Iskandar"&gt;Jessica Iskandar&lt;/a&gt;, Shenny Andrea saka Indonésia. Ana pawarta yèn &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; iki ngentèkaké béya kang gunggungé 3 &lt;a href="yuta"&gt;yuta&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="ringgit"&gt;ringgit&lt;/a&gt; utawa punjul &lt;a href="7%2C7"&gt;7,7&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="milyar"&gt;milyar&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="rupiah"&gt;rupiah&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Soundtrack"&gt;Soundtrack&lt;/a&gt; filem cacahé ana 40 &lt;a href="lagu"&gt;lagu&lt;/a&gt; kang dinyanyèkaké &lt;a href="artis"&gt;artis&lt;/a&gt; Malaysia-Indonésia kaya ta &lt;a href="Krisdayanti"&gt;Krisdayanti&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Vina%20Panduwinata"&gt;Vina Panduwinata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Siti%20Nurhaliza"&gt;Siti Nurhaliza&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Ning%20Baizura"&gt;Ning Baizura&lt;/a&gt;.
