Parlin Burman Siburian (populèr kanthi jeneng Pay; #ALIH). Pay ya iku &lt;a href="musik"&gt;musik&lt;/a&gt;us kang asalé saka &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt;. Pay iku anggota saka band &lt;a href="rock"&gt;rock&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="BIP"&gt;BIP&lt;/a&gt; kang wis nggawé album kang cacahé loro ya iku &lt;a href="album"&gt;album&lt;/a&gt; kang judhulé &lt;a href="Turun%20dari%20langit"&gt;Turun dari langit&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Min%20Plus"&gt;Min Plus&lt;/a&gt;..
Pay iku mantan anggotané &lt;a href="Slank"&gt;Slank&lt;/a&gt;. Pay lumebu &lt;a href="Slank"&gt;Slank&lt;/a&gt; nalika &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1989"&gt;1989&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika iku Pay tepung karo &lt;a href="prodhuser"&gt;prodhuser&lt;/a&gt; lan njajal nawakaké dhémo musiké Slank. Pungkasané Slank wiwit rekaman nalika &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1990"&gt;1990&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika iku Slank kasusun saka personil kang cacahé lima. Déné personilé ya iku Pay, &lt;a href="Bimbim"&gt;Bimbim&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bongky"&gt;Bongky&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Indra"&gt;Indra&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Kaka"&gt;Kaka&lt;/a&gt;.
Pay tau nggabung karo &lt;a href="Andy%20Liany"&gt;Andy Liany&lt;/a&gt;, Ronald, lan &lt;a href="Once"&gt;Once&lt;/a&gt;. Wong telu iki banjur mbentuk &lt;a href="Fargat%2027"&gt;Fargat 27&lt;/a&gt;, lan nggawé album kang judhulé &lt;a href="Seribu%20Angan"&gt;Seribu Angan&lt;/a&gt;.
Pay banjur palakrama karo &lt;a href="Cynthia%20Dewi%20Bayu%20Wardhani"&gt;Cynthia Dewi Bayu Wardhani&lt;/a&gt; utawa kang luwih ditepungi kanthi jeneng &lt;a href="Dewiq"&gt;Dewiq&lt;/a&gt;. Dewiq iku penyanyi kang asalé saka &lt;a href="Ujung%20Pandang"&gt;Ujung Pandang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt;. Saliyané iku, Dewiq uga dadi &lt;a href="musikus"&gt;musikus&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="penyanyi"&gt;penyanyi&lt;/a&gt;. Nanging Pay banjur pegatan karo Dewiq. Sawisé pegatan karo Dewiq, taun &lt;a href="2010"&gt;2010&lt;/a&gt; Pay banjur palakrama karo &lt;a href="Irene%20Anastasya%20Pricilia"&gt;Irene Anastasya Pricilia&lt;/a&gt;.
