Prèsen utawa Prusen utawa Pruisen (&lt;a href="basa%20Jerman"&gt;basa Jerman&lt;/a&gt;: Preußen, &lt;a href="basa%20Latin"&gt;basa Latin&lt;/a&gt;: Borussia, Prussia utawa Prutenia; &lt;a href="basa%20Polen"&gt;basa Polen&lt;/a&gt; Prusy; &lt;a href="basa%20Ruslan"&gt;basa Ruslan&lt;/a&gt;: Пруссия) asalé iku jeneng siji laladan ing &lt;a href="%C3%89ropa%20W%C3%A9tan"&gt;Éropa Wétan&lt;/a&gt; ing sapinggiré &lt;a href="Laut%20Baltik"&gt;Laut Baltik&lt;/a&gt; ing endi siji bangsa Baltik sing isih duwé kerabat karo wong &lt;a href="Litowen"&gt;Litowen&lt;/a&gt; lan wong &lt;a href="L%C3%A8tlan"&gt;Lètlan&lt;/a&gt; tau manggon. Wong-wong mau nuturaké &lt;a href="basa%20Prusia%20Kuna"&gt;basa Prusia Kuna&lt;/a&gt; minangka basa ibuné nganti basa iki cures nalika &lt;a href="abad%20kaping-15"&gt;abad kaping-15&lt;/a&gt;. Wektu iku wong-wong mau migunakaké basa Jerman lan wis mbaur karo wong-wong Jerman.
Wewengkon Prusia saiki dipérang antara &lt;a href="Ruslan"&gt;Ruslan&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Polen"&gt;Polen&lt;/a&gt;. Wewengkon Ruslan diarani laladan &lt;a href="Kaliningrad"&gt;Kaliningrad&lt;/a&gt; (Kaliningradskaya oblast) éwadéné wewengkon Polen diarani &lt;a href="Warmia"&gt;Warmia&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Mazuria"&gt;Mazuria&lt;/a&gt;.
