<doc id="76799" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=76799" title="White Lion">
White Lion

<ol>
<li>ALIH</<li>
</ol>
White Lion ya iku grup musik &lt;a href="hard%20rock"&gt;hard rock&lt;/a&gt;/&lt;a href="heavy%20metal"&gt;heavy metal&lt;/a&gt; kang asalé saka &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;/&lt;a href="Dh%C3%A8nemarken"&gt;Dhènemarken&lt;/a&gt; lan diwangun ning &lt;a href="New%20York"&gt;New York&lt;/a&gt; nalika taun &lt;a href="1983"&gt;1983&lt;/a&gt; déning &lt;a href="Mike%20Tramp"&gt;Mike Tramp&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Vito%20Bratta"&gt;Vito Bratta&lt;/a&gt;, grup musik iki aktif nalika taun &lt;a href="1980"&gt;1980&lt;/a&gt;an lan awal taun &lt;a href="1990"&gt;1990&lt;/a&gt;an, Ning awal kariré, White Lion nglewati dalan kang ora mulus ning awal kariré.
Albumé kang kaping pisanan, judhulé FIGHT TO SURVIVE ora sida dirilis.
Amarga Elektra Records papané grup musik iki naung ora puas karo album kang digawé déning grup musik iki.
Untungé RCA nuli njukut album iki supaya diedaraké ning &lt;a href="Jepang"&gt;Jepang&lt;/a&gt; kang sawisé iku dimeluni déning &lt;a href="Grand%20Slamm"&gt;Grand Slamm&lt;/a&gt; ning sabuah label indie ning
Amérikah Sarékat kang ngrilis albumé ning pasar &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika"&gt;Amérika&lt;/a&gt;.
Grup musik iki dimotori déning &lt;a href="Mike%20Tramp"&gt;Mike Tramp&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Vitto%20Bratta"&gt;Vitto Bratta&lt;/a&gt; iki nembé bisa ambekan lega nalika albumé kang kaping
kaloroné saka grup musik iki, judhulé PRIDE dijukut déning Atlantic Records.
Album iki kaedol akèh amarga single andalan grup musik iki When the Children Cry.
Albumé kang paling papat grup musik iki judhulé MANE ATTRACTION gagal ning pasar &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika"&gt;Amérika&lt;/a&gt; amarga demam grunge kang lagi ngelanda nalika wektu iku.
Nanging ning &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt;, White Lion identik karo album MANE ATTRACTION.
Lagu-lagu kaya ta You're All I Need, Broken Heart, lan Till Death Do Us Part.
White Lion mutusaké kanggo bubar sawisé albumé kang kaping papat nanging &lt;a href="Mike%20Tramp"&gt;Mike Tramp&lt;/a&gt; kang dadi motor ning grup musik iki.
Tetep péngin ngelajutaké Grup musik White Lion manèh, meski tanpa &lt;a href="Vitto%20Bratta"&gt;Vitto Bratta&lt;/a&gt;.
Taun &lt;a href="2010"&gt;2010&lt;/a&gt;, Grup musik White Lion mèlu ngramekaké acara The Best of Rock Legend Concert ning MU Cafe, jum'at 23 Fèbruari 2010.
Acara iki dianakaké déning Djiwa Arts Management kang kerja sama karo Mars August Production sarta dijurung déning KapanLagi.com.
Ning acara iki, ana uga panampilané &lt;a href="Toto%20Tewel"&gt;Toto Tewel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Doddy%20Katamsi"&gt;Doddy Katamsi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Heydi"&gt;Heydi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jikun%20Rif"&gt;Jikun Rif&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jon%20Angel%27z"&gt;Jon Angel'z&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Iram%20U%27Camp"&gt;Iram U'Camp&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Rico%20The%20Acid"&gt;Rico The Acid&lt;/a&gt;.
Kang dadi bintang ning acara iku, White Lion nggawakaké tetembangan hits kang judhulé Till Death Do Us Part, Broken Herat, You're all Need, lan When The Chilrens Cry.
Sarta tetembangan, Another Brick on The Wall (&lt;a href="Pink%20Floyd"&gt;Pink Floyd&lt;/a&gt;), Imagine (&lt;a href="The%20Beatles"&gt;The Beatles&lt;/a&gt;), Don't Look Back In anger (&lt;a href="Oasis"&gt;Oasis&lt;/a&gt;), Knocking On Heavens Door
(&lt;a href="Guns%20N%20Roses"&gt;Guns N Roses&lt;/a&gt;).
