Award babagan kategori aktris kang paling apik.
Debuté nalika dadi penyanyi, diawali nalika Latifah ngrilis album nalika taun &lt;a href="1989"&gt;1989&lt;/a&gt; kang judhulé
All Hail the Queen, sawisé iku nyusul manèh ning taun
&lt;a href="1991"&gt;1991&lt;/a&gt; ngrilis album kang judhulé Nature of a Sister', nuli ning
taun &lt;a href="1993"&gt;1993&lt;/a&gt; Latifah ngrilis album kang judhulé Black Reign, album liyané
kaya ta Order in the Court, dirilis nalika taun &lt;a href="1998"&gt;1998&lt;/a&gt;, She's the Queen:
A Collection of Hits, nalika taun &lt;a href="2002"&gt;2002&lt;/a&gt; lan The Dana Owens Albu, dirilis nalika taun &lt;a href="2004"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt;.
Ora namung iku, ning dunya akting.
Debut awalé ya iku ning taun &lt;a href="1991"&gt;1991&lt;/a&gt; nalika dhèwèké ngawali ning &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; House Party 2, Juice (nalika taun &lt;a href="1992"&gt;1992&lt;/a&gt;),
