Camptosaurus

Camptosaurus (kapocapaké /ˌkæmptɵˈsɔrəs/ kamp-to-sawr-əs) iku &lt;a href="k%C3%A9wan"&gt;kéwan&lt;/a&gt; pamangan &lt;a href="tuwuhan"&gt;tuwuhan&lt;/a&gt; kang duwé cucuk &lt;a href="dinosaurus"&gt;dinosaurus&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Ornithischian"&gt;Ornithischian&lt;/a&gt; periode &lt;a href="Jurassik"&gt;Jurassik&lt;/a&gt; akir saka pérangan wétané &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Lor"&gt;Amérika Lor&lt;/a&gt;. Jeneng iki artiné "kadal sing fleksibel" (καμπτος Yunani / kamptos tegesé'mbungkuk' lan σαυρος / sauros tegesé 'kadal').
Nalika tanggal &lt;a href="4%20September"&gt;4 September&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1879"&gt;1879&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="William%20Reed%20Harlow"&gt;William Reed Harlow&lt;/a&gt; ing Albany County, Wyoming nemu sisa-sisa euornithopod cilik. Ing taun kang padha, Profesor &lt;a href="Charles%20Marsh%20Otniel"&gt;Charles Marsh Otniel&lt;/a&gt; nemu Camptonotus, saka κάμπτω &lt;a href="Yunani"&gt;Yunani&lt;/a&gt;.
