Jackman uga dipercaya manèh mainaké karakter &lt;a href="Wolverine"&gt;Wolverine&lt;/a&gt; ning &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="franchise%20X-MEN"&gt;franchise X-MEN&lt;/a&gt;.
&lt;a href="Film"&gt;Film&lt;/a&gt; Wolverine mau judhulé.
Taun &lt;a href="2011"&gt;2011&lt;/a&gt;, Jackman nyoba kanggo main &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; ning dunya filem &lt;a href="Bollywood"&gt;Bollywood&lt;/a&gt;.
Dhèwèké wiwit remen karo dunya &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Bolywood"&gt;Bolywood&lt;/a&gt; nalika didapuk dadi juri ning acara taunan konvensi FICCI Frames nalika
