Hilary Swank

Hilary Ann Swank kondhang uga karo jeneng Hilary Swank ning &lt;a href="masarakat"&gt;masarakat&lt;/a&gt; (#ALIH) ya iku &lt;a href="aktris"&gt;aktris&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, karier &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Hollywood"&gt;Hollywood&lt;/a&gt; wiwit ning filem &lt;a href="Buffy%20the%20Vampire%20Slayer%20%28filem%29"&gt;Buffy the Vampire Slayer&lt;/a&gt; (nalika taun &lt;a href="1992"&gt;1992&lt;/a&gt;), dhèwèké dadi kondhang sawisé menang &lt;a href="Academy%20Award"&gt;Academy Award&lt;/a&gt; ning rong &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; dadi &lt;a href="Brandon%20Teena"&gt;Brandon Teena&lt;/a&gt;, filem &lt;a href="Boys%20Don%27t%20Cry%20%28filem%29"&gt;Boys Don't Cry&lt;/a&gt;
lan dadi Maggie Fitzgerald, ning &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Million%20Dollar%20Baby"&gt;Million Dollar Baby&lt;/a&gt;.
Pindah saka &lt;a href="Washington"&gt;Washington&lt;/a&gt; maring Los Angeles nalika umuré 16 taun,
dhèwèké duwé kasempatan main peran ning &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; kang judhulé HARRY AND THE HENDERSON,
ora namung iku, dhèwèké uga tau mainaké peran ning &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; liyané,
kaya ta ning serial Tivi kang judhulé EVENING SHADE (CBS) lan GROWING PAINS (ABC).
filem mau iku diputer ning tivi awit taun &lt;a href="1991"&gt;1991&lt;/a&gt; nganti taun &lt;a href="1992"&gt;1992&lt;/a&gt;,
sadurungé dhèwèké uga mainakaé peran ning &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; serial Tivi bebarengan karo
&lt;a href="Sarah%20Michel%20Gellar"&gt;Sarah Michel Gellar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; mau judhulé &lt;a href="BUFFY%20THE%20VAMPIRE%20SLAYER"&gt;BUFFY THE VAMPIRE SLAYER&lt;/a&gt;, diputer nalika taun &lt;a href="1992"&gt;1992&lt;/a&gt;,
Ning sajarah kauripané, Hilary Swank uga duwé prestasi kang ora mbanggakaké
dhèwèké bisa nyingkiraké ewunan aktris nalika ngrebutaké tokoh ning audisi &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="THE%20NEXT%20KARATE%20KID"&gt;THE NEXT KARATE KID&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1994"&gt;1994&lt;/a&gt;).
Watara taun &lt;a href="1992"&gt;1992&lt;/a&gt; nganti taun &lt;a href="1997"&gt;1997&lt;/a&gt; Swank mainaké peran ning serial TV kang judhulé &lt;a href="ABC"&gt;ABC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="CAMP%20WILDER%20%28ABC%29"&gt;CAMP WILDER (ABC)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="SOMETIMES%20THEY%20COME%20BACK...%20AGAIN"&gt;SOMETIMES THEY COME BACK... AGAIN&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1994"&gt;1994&lt;/a&gt;),
&lt;a href="KOUNTERFEIT"&gt;KOUNTERFEIT&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1997"&gt;1997&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="TERROR%20IN%20THE%20FAMILY"&gt;TERROR IN THE FAMILY&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="DYING%20TO%20BELONG"&gt;DYING TO BELONG&lt;/a&gt;
(NBC, &lt;a href="1997"&gt;1997&lt;/a&gt;) lan serial filem &lt;a href="LEAVING%20L.A."&gt;LEAVING L.A.&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1997"&gt;1997&lt;/a&gt;),
Aktingé bisa anggawe &lt;a href="masarakat"&gt;masarakat&lt;/a&gt; kesengsem lan seneng nalika dhèwèké mainaké peran dadi single parent ning serial Tv kang kondhang kanthi judhul Beverly Hills, 90210 (&lt;a href="1997"&gt;1997&lt;/a&gt;).
Jenengé kang ora patiya kondhang, tansah misuwur lan dadi bahan omongan nalika dhèwèké
meranaké &lt;a href="Teena%20Brandon"&gt;Teena Brandon&lt;/a&gt;, wanita saka &lt;a href="Nebraska"&gt;Nebraska&lt;/a&gt; kang luwih milih urip dadi priya ning &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Boys%20Don%27t%20Cry"&gt;Boys Don't Cry&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1999"&gt;1999&lt;/a&gt;).
Film Boy, Don't Cry iki nyeritakaké kisah kang memang temenan anané.
Amarga kasiapané kang apik, akiré dhèwèké bisa meranaké, kanthi sukses lan bisa ngeraih panghargaan
Academy Award kategori aktris paling apik.
Sawisé olih panghargaan Academy Award, Swank olih tawaran kanggo main &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt;.
Kaya ta &lt;a href="fim"&gt;fim&lt;/a&gt; kang judhulé The Gift kang diputer nalika taun &lt;a href="2000"&gt;2000&lt;/a&gt;,
filem kang ngisahaké wanita kang ngalami kekerasan ning njeroning kauripan bebrayanan.
Banjur iku, dhèwèké uga mainaké peran ning &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; kang judhulé The Affair of the Necklace, filem kang diputer nalika taun &lt;a href="2001"&gt;2001&lt;/a&gt;
iki ngisahaké babagan wanita &lt;a href="Prancis"&gt;Prancis&lt;/a&gt; kang dikurmati ning &lt;a href="masarakat"&gt;masarakat&lt;/a&gt;.
Bebarengan karo &lt;a href="Al%20Pacino"&gt;Al Pacino&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Robin%20William"&gt;Robin William&lt;/a&gt;, dhèwèké mainaké peran ning &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt;
garapané &lt;a href="Christopher%20Nolan"&gt;Christopher Nolan&lt;/a&gt; kang judhulé Insomnia, Dhèwèké uga bebarengan karo &lt;a href="Aaron%20Eckhart"&gt;Aaron Eckhart&lt;/a&gt;, mainaké peran ning &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; fiksi ilmiah kang judhulé The Core (&lt;a href="2003"&gt;2003&lt;/a&gt;).
Amarga pangorbanané ning dunya hiburan kang ora sedelak iku, Swank olih panghargaan Golden Globe
kanggo kategori aktris paling apil ning mini seri utawa filem televisi amarga aktingé ning &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt;
produksi HBO, Iron Jawed Angels nalika taun [[2004,
Disusul panampilané ning &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; Million Dollar Baby filem garapan &lt;a href="Clint%20Eastwood"&gt;Clint Eastwood&lt;/a&gt; kang dirilis nalika taun &lt;a href="2004"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt;,
dhèwèké meranaké petinju, amarga perané kang ora biyasa mau, dhèwèké
ngusahakaké kanggo mbentuk awaké supaya mbentuk lan berotot.
Amarga pangudiné kanggo menghayati perané dhèwèké ngeraih panghargaan saka Golden Globe manèh.
Nalika taun &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt; Swank wiwit mèlu dadi pandukung
&lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; The Black Dahlia, filem filsi kang dirilis nalika taun &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;.
Film mau nyeritakaké babagan carita filsi babagan obsesi, cinta lan katamakan,
Setaun sawisé iku, Swank mainaké peran manèh ning &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; kang judhulé Freedom Writers,
meranaké &lt;a href="Erin%20Gruwell"&gt;Erin Gruwell&lt;/a&gt;, guru saka &lt;a href="California"&gt;California&lt;/a&gt; kang ngajara ning kelas multi rasial.
Dhèwèké uga mainaké peran ning &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; PS, I Love You dadi janda kang ditinggal mati déning garwané kang sawisé iku nemu sapuluh pesan saka garwané, kang isiné babagan cara supaya
ngilangaké rasa sedhih lan ngelanjutaké urip anyar manèh.
Taun &lt;a href="2011"&gt;2011&lt;/a&gt;, Hilary Swank gagal muteraké filemé ning biyoskup-biyoskup.
Film kang didistribusikaké déning Exclusive Film Distribution kang rencanané bakal langsung dirilis kanthi wujud DVD iku akiré gagal tayang.
Nanging meski gagal ditayangaké ning &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; kang judhulé The Resident
