<doc id="76874" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=76874" title="Bruce Willis">
Bruce Willis

Bruce Willis (#ALIH) dhèwèké &lt;a href="aktor"&gt;aktor&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, jeneng kang kondhang ning &lt;a href="masarakat"&gt;masarakat&lt;/a&gt; ya iku &lt;a href="John%20McClane"&gt;John McClane&lt;/a&gt;, jejeneng kang diolih nalika main ning &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Die%20Hard"&gt;Die Hard&lt;/a&gt;, dhèwèké iku mantan garwané &lt;a href="Demi%20Moore"&gt;Demi Moore&lt;/a&gt;, Bruce Willis kondhang ning &lt;a href="masarakat"&gt;masarakat&lt;/a&gt; awit main ning serial TV hit MOONLIGHTING watara taun &lt;a href="1985"&gt;1985&lt;/a&gt; nganti taun &lt;a href="1989"&gt;1989&lt;/a&gt; lan perané dadi &lt;a href="John%20McClane"&gt;John McClane&lt;/a&gt;
ning serial &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; DIE HARD (filem nalika taun 1988).
Ning akir taun &lt;a href="1990"&gt;1990&lt;/a&gt;, Willis tau ngrilis album pop-blues, album mau diwènèhi judhul The Return of Bruno, kaya ta single kang dadi andalané ning album mau, Respect Yourself.
Ning &lt;a href="sajarah"&gt;sajarah&lt;/a&gt; pribadiné, Willis tau bebrayanan karo &lt;a href="aktris"&gt;aktris&lt;/a&gt; ayu &lt;a href="Demi%20Moore"&gt;Demi Moore&lt;/a&gt;, meski akiré bebrayanan iku gagal,
sawisé urip bareng nganti 13 taun suwené, Willis karo Demi Moore akiré cerai ning tanggal &lt;a href="28%20Oktober"&gt;28 Oktober&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="2000"&gt;2000&lt;/a&gt;.
Sadurungé karo &lt;a href="Demi%20Moore"&gt;Demi Moore&lt;/a&gt;, Willis uga tau njalin gayutan raket karo &lt;a href="aktris"&gt;aktris&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="model"&gt;model&lt;/a&gt; kang pagaweané ora adoh kaya ta dhèwèké, padha-padha njegur ning dunya hiburan, kenya ayu kang tau dikabaraké raket karo Bruce Willis iku kaya ta &lt;a href="aktris"&gt;aktris&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Lara%20Flynn%20Boyle"&gt;Lara Flynn Boyle&lt;/a&gt; lan bintang model &lt;a href="Maria%20Bravo%20Rosado"&gt;Maria Bravo Rosado&lt;/a&gt;.
Sangang taun ditinggal dhèwèkan déning &lt;a href="Demi%20Moore"&gt;Demi Moore&lt;/a&gt; akiré ning taun &lt;a href="2009"&gt;2009&lt;/a&gt;, Willis meluni mantan bojoné kanggo nikah manèh.
Dhèwèké olih panggantiné &lt;a href="Demi%20Moore"&gt;Demi Moore&lt;/a&gt;, nuli tanggal &lt;a href="22%20Maret"&gt;22 Maret&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="2009"&gt;2009&lt;/a&gt;, Willis resmi nikah karo pepujaning atiné, ya iku
&lt;a href="Emma%20Heming"&gt;Emma Heming&lt;/a&gt;.
Pernikahan mau ditindakaké kanthi meriyah ning &lt;a href="Turks"&gt;Turks&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Caicos"&gt;Caicos&lt;/a&gt;.
