<doc id="76877" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=76877" title="Elijah Wood">
Elijah Wood

Elijah Jordan Wood (#ALIH) dhèwèké aktor &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; kang dhuwuré 168&amp;nbsp;cm, dhèwèké kondhang nalika main ning &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; trilogy kang judhulé &lt;a href="The%20Lords%20of%20The%20Ring"&gt;The Lords of The Ring&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Aktor"&gt;Aktor&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika"&gt;Amérika&lt;/a&gt; iki anggawe debut &lt;a href="filem%C3%A9"&gt;filemé&lt;/a&gt; dadi peran pembantu
cilik-cilikan ning &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; BACK TO THE FUTURE PART II (nalika taun 1989).
Dhèwèké iku anak kaping loro saka telu anak.
Miwiti kariré dadi modhèl bayaran.
Dhèwèké uga tau meu ning video &lt;a href="Paula%20Abdul"&gt;Paula Abdul&lt;/a&gt;, nganti akiré
dhèwèké wiwit dilirik karo para prodhuser.
Elijah miwiti karir ning dunya peran kang luwih luwas awit umuré 9 taun.
Awit iku dhèwèké wiwit diakoni ddai artis vilik kang duwé potensi.
Elijah Wood kondhang amarga perané dadi Frodo Baggins ning &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; trilogi THE LORD OF THE RINGS,
&lt;a href="Film"&gt;Film&lt;/a&gt; kang dijukut saka &lt;a href="nov%C3%A8l"&gt;novèl&lt;/a&gt; kang judhulé padha, karyané &lt;a href="J.R.R%20Tolkien"&gt;J.R.R Tolkien&lt;/a&gt;.
Awit iku kariré tambah maju lan olih peran ning filem-filem liyané, kaya ta &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; kang judhulé BOBBY,
ETERNAL SUNSHINE OF THE SPOTLESS MIND, SIN CITY, GREEN STREET dan EVERYTHING IS ILLUMINATED.
Elijah tau mbintangi filem DAY ZERO (2007), lan mampu nyuarakaké karakter mligi kanthi apik (Mumble),
ning filem animasi kang judhulé HAPPY FEET.
Dhewekémainaké peran dadi turis &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika"&gt;Amérika&lt;/a&gt; kang dadi vampir ning &lt;a href="PARIS"&gt;PARIS&lt;/a&gt;, JE T'AIME.
Nalika taun &lt;a href="2005"&gt;2005&lt;/a&gt;, dhèwèké wiwit ngadegaké label rekamané dhéwé, Simian Records.
Taun &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;, dhèwèké ddai &lt;a href="aktor"&gt;aktor&lt;/a&gt; pangisi swara kang kondhang ning video game lan dadi ikon video game SPYRO THE DRAGON.
Taun &lt;a href="2008"&gt;2008&lt;/a&gt;, dhèwèké dadi wong pisanan kang nyeberang Victoria Falls karo tali ning perané kang judhulé ADRENALIN JUNKIE.
Taun &lt;a href="2011"&gt;2011&lt;/a&gt;, dhèwèké main ning &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; THE HOBBIT, &lt;a href="filem"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; fiksi déning &lt;a href="Peter%20Jackson"&gt;Peter Jackson&lt;/a&gt;.
&lt;a href="Film"&gt;Film&lt;/a&gt; iki langsung digarap déning Peter, ya iku THE HOBBIT: AN UNEXPECTED JOURNEY diputer tanggal &lt;a href="14%20Desembar"&gt;14 Desembar&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="2012"&gt;2012&lt;/a&gt; lan THE HOBBIT: THERE AND BACK AGAIN
kang dijadwalaké ning tanggal &lt;a href="13%20Dh%C3%A9s%C3%A8mber"&gt;13 Dhésèmber&lt;/a&gt; taun 2013]].
Mulai syutingé ning &lt;a href="New%20Zealand"&gt;New Zealand&lt;/a&gt; bebarengan karo &lt;a href="Orlando%20Bloom"&gt;Orlando Bloom&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ian%20McKellen"&gt;Ian McKellen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Cate%20Blanchett"&gt;Cate Blanchett&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Hugo%20Weaving"&gt;Hugo Weaving&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Stephen%20Fry"&gt;Stephen Fry&lt;/a&gt;.
