Alas Białowieża

Alas Bialowieza ya iku sawijining &lt;a href="alas"&gt;alas&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="reservasi"&gt;reservasi&lt;/a&gt; kang dumunung ing 145 mil sisih wétan &lt;a href="Warsawa"&gt;Warsawa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Polen"&gt;Polen&lt;/a&gt; lan wewatesan karo nagara &lt;a href="B%C3%A9larus"&gt;Bélarus&lt;/a&gt;.
 Alas &lt;a href="taman%20nasional"&gt;taman nasional&lt;/a&gt; iki dadi panggonan perlindungan tumrap &lt;a href="bison%20eropa"&gt;bison eropa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="rusa%20elk"&gt;rusa elk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="babi%20alas"&gt;babi alas&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="rusa"&gt;rusa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="srenggala"&gt;srenggala&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="lynx"&gt;lynx&lt;/a&gt; sarta &lt;a href="berang-berang"&gt;berang-berang&lt;/a&gt; lan uga minangka habitat &lt;a href="alas%20primer"&gt;alas primer&lt;/a&gt;, campuran &lt;a href="alas%20rontok"&gt;alas rontok&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="alas%20konifer"&gt;alas konifer&lt;/a&gt;.
Alas iki dadi &lt;a href="Situs%20Warisan%20Dunia"&gt;Situs Warisan Dunia&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="UNESCO"&gt;UNESCO&lt;/a&gt; ing taun 1992 lan pérangan &lt;a href="B%C3%A9larus"&gt;Bélarus&lt;/a&gt; didadèkaké minangka &lt;a href="Biosphere%20Reserve%20under%20UNESCO%27s%20Man%20and%20the%20Biosphere%20Programme"&gt;Biosphere Reserve under UNESCO's Man and the Biosphere Programme&lt;/a&gt; (Cagar Biosfer di bawah Program Manusia dan Biosfer UNESCO) ing taun 1993 (pérangan &lt;a href="Polen"&gt;Polen&lt;/a&gt; wis disahke ing taun 1976).
<h2>Sajarah lan proteksi</h2>
Sajarah lan proteksi.
Suwene nganti 500 taun alas Bialowieza dadi panggonan &lt;a href="ngajag"&gt;ngajag&lt;/a&gt; favorit ratu-ratu &lt;a href="Polen"&gt;Polen&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="tsar%20Ruslan"&gt;tsar Ruslan&lt;/a&gt;, kang dadekake minangka panggonan kang dilarang kanggo dieksploitasi. Proteksi iki dadekake wewengkon Bialowieza minangka sisa &lt;a href="alas"&gt;alas&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="%C3%89ropa"&gt;Éropa&lt;/a&gt; kang isih asri nganti abad kaping 20, nanging suwéné &lt;a href="Perang%20Dunia%20I"&gt;Perang Dunia I&lt;/a&gt;, status perlindungan mau rampung. Antarane taun 1915 lan 1918 alas iki dikuasai déning &lt;a href="wadya"&gt;wadya&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt; kang nebang akèhé 5 juta mèter kubik kayu kanggo keperluan perang lan ngrusak pérangan kang gedhé saka uripé kang alasan. Akeh-akèhé karusakane ana ing 3 wulan wiwitan ya iku nalika akèh spésies-spésies gedhé diajag kanggo konsumsi wadya. aNalika wiwitane perang, ana 700 &lt;a href="rusa%20elk"&gt;rusa elk&lt;/a&gt; ing Bialowieza lan nalika perang bubar, mung ana 3 kang isih sisa. &lt;a href="Babi%20alas"&gt;Babi alas&lt;/a&gt; mula-mulane ana 2300 lan &lt;a href="rusa%20abang"&gt;rusa abang&lt;/a&gt; knag mula-mulane akèh mung sisa 6. &lt;a href="Bison%20eropa"&gt;Bison&lt;/a&gt; kang minangka kéwan gedhé dhéwé ing kéné dadi kalong ya iku saka 727 ing wulan Agustus taun 1915 dadi 120 ing wulan Dhésèmber 1915, lan sudane iki nalika ana perang.
<h2>Fauna</h2>
Fauna.
Alas Bialowieza duwé habitat &lt;a href="fauna"&gt;fauna&lt;/a&gt; kang akèh, ing antarané ya iku 8500 jinis &lt;a href="gegremet"&gt;gegremet&lt;/a&gt;, 206 spésies &lt;a href="laba-laba"&gt;laba-laba&lt;/a&gt;, 24 spésies &lt;a href="iwak"&gt;iwak&lt;/a&gt;, 228 spésies &lt;a href="manuk"&gt;manuk&lt;/a&gt; (48 &lt;a href="endemis"&gt;endemis&lt;/a&gt;) – kalebu &lt;a href="black%20sork"&gt;black sork&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="bangau"&gt;bangau&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="garudha"&gt;garudha&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="beluk"&gt;beluk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="kite%20%28manuk%29"&gt;kite&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="ruff"&gt;ruff&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="grouse"&gt;grouse&lt;/a&gt; ireng, &lt;a href="capercaillie"&gt;capercaillie&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="roller%20%28burung%29"&gt;roller&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="hoopoe"&gt;hoopoe&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="crossbill"&gt;crossbill&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="ortolan"&gt;ortolan&lt;/a&gt;. Spesies &lt;a href="mamalia"&gt;mamalia&lt;/a&gt; ing antarané ya iku mamalia cilik kaya ta &lt;a href="landak"&gt;landak&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="mole"&gt;mole&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="vole"&gt;vole&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="shrew"&gt;shrew&lt;/a&gt;, 13 spésies &lt;a href="lawa"&gt;lawa&lt;/a&gt;, 19 spésies &lt;a href="pengerat"&gt;pengerat&lt;/a&gt;, uga ana &lt;a href="rubah"&gt;rubah&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="luwak"&gt;luwak&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="berang-berang"&gt;berang-berang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="rakun"&gt;rakun&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="marten"&gt;marten&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="polecat"&gt;polecat&lt;/a&gt; dlan &lt;a href="hare%20coklat"&gt;hare coklat&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Kucing%20alas"&gt;Kucing alas&lt;/a&gt; sarta &lt;a href="srenggala"&gt;srenggala&lt;/a&gt; kang wis suwé cures lan bruwang coklat kang pungkasan cures ing taun 1963. Nalika taun 1976 dhedhasar panaliten ilmuwan Polen, populasi mamalia gedhé ana 936 &lt;a href="rusa%20abang"&gt;rusa abang&lt;/a&gt;, 522 &lt;a href="rusa%20roe"&gt;rusa roe&lt;/a&gt;, 803 &lt;a href="babi%20alas"&gt;babi alas&lt;/a&gt;, 49 &lt;a href="rusa%20elk"&gt;rusa elk&lt;/a&gt;, 13 &lt;a href="lynx"&gt;lynx&lt;/a&gt;, 3 &lt;a href="srenggala"&gt;srenggala&lt;/a&gt; lan punjul 250 buntut &lt;a href="bison%20eropa"&gt;bison eropa&lt;/a&gt;.
