<doc id="77129" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=77129" title="Bangalore">
Bangalore

Bengaluru (&lt;a href="basa%20Kannada"&gt;basa Kannada&lt;/a&gt;: ಬೆಂಗಳೂರು) (&lt;a href="Alfabet%20Fonetik%20Internasional"&gt;diwaca&lt;/a&gt; /'bɛŋgəɫurʊ/ sajeroning basa Kannada lan /'bæŋgəlʊɹ/ sajeroning &lt;a href="basa%20Inggris"&gt;basa Inggris&lt;/a&gt;) iku kutha krajan lan kutha gedhé dhéwé ing Praja &lt;a href="India"&gt;India&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Karnataka"&gt;Karnataka&lt;/a&gt;. Kutha iki uga karan "Kutha Taman" amarga taman-taman, kembang, lan wit-witané sing éndah. Bengaluru wujud kutha gedhé dhéwé katelu lan &lt;a href="metropolitan"&gt;metropolitan&lt;/a&gt; gedhé dhéwé kalima, kanthi populasi nalika taun &lt;a href="2001"&gt;2001&lt;/a&gt; gunggungé 6,5 yuta. Sadurungé 1 November 2006, jeneng kutha iki ya iku Bangalore.
Sawisé India éntuk &lt;a href="Gerakan%20Kamardikan%20India"&gt;kamardikan&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="1947"&gt;1947&lt;/a&gt;, Bengaluru révolusi dadi sawijining hub prodhuksi kanggo &lt;a href="indhustri%20abot"&gt;indhustri abot&lt;/a&gt; kaya ta &lt;a href="Hindustan%20Aeronautics%20Limited"&gt;Hindustan Aeronautics Limited&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Indian%20Space%20Research%20Organization"&gt;Indian Space Research Organization&lt;/a&gt;. Sajeroning dékade pungkasan, pambentukan lan suksès perusahaan &lt;a href="t%C3%A8knologi%20dhuwur"&gt;tèknologi dhuwur&lt;/a&gt; ing Bangaluru wis njalari tuwuhing &lt;a href="t%C3%A8knologi%20informasi"&gt;tèknologi informasi&lt;/a&gt; ing India. Perusahaan IT ing Bengaluru makaryakaké watara 30% saka sayuta profésional IT India.
Kutha iki uga wujud pusat pelatihan kanggo &lt;a href="Angkatan%20Udara%20India"&gt;Angkatan Udara India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Madras%20Engineering%20Group"&gt;Madras Engineering Group&lt;/a&gt; (EMG), lan &lt;a href="pulisi%20milit%C3%A8r"&gt;pulisi militèr&lt;/a&gt; pusat, loro sing pungkasan wujud lengen &lt;a href="Angkatan%20Bersenjata%20India"&gt;Angkatan Bersenjata India&lt;/a&gt;.
Bengaluru wujud pangkalan èlmiah India lan wujud papan universitas risèt tuwa dhéwé India, &lt;a href="Indian%20Institute%20of%20Science"&gt;Indian Institute of Science&lt;/a&gt;. Institut risèt liyané kalebu Indian Institute of Astrophysics, the Raman Research Institute, the Jawaharlal Nehru Centre for Advanced Scientific Research, the National Center for Biological Science lan the Indian Statistical Institute.

