Annisa Larasati Pohan (#ALIH). Annisa Pohan iku salah sijiné modhél kang asalé &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt;. Annisa Pohan ngugemi &lt;a href="agama"&gt;agama&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Islam"&gt;Islam&lt;/a&gt;. Dhèwèké tau dadi juwara ing ajang pemilihan Gadis Shampo 2001. Sadurungé iku Annisa Pohan tau dadi finalis &lt;a href="GADIS%20Sampul"&gt;GADIS Sampul&lt;/a&gt; nalika &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1997"&gt;1997&lt;/a&gt;.
Gelar kang cacahé loro iki ndadékaké Annisa Pohan bisa dadi &lt;a href="artis"&gt;artis&lt;/a&gt;. Annisa Pohan langsung dikontrak dadi modhél &lt;a href="iklan"&gt;iklan&lt;/a&gt;. Ora mung dadi modhel &lt;a href="iklan"&gt;iklan&lt;/a&gt;, Annisa uga njajal donyaning &lt;a href="broadcasting"&gt;broadcasting&lt;/a&gt; lan dadi penyiar &lt;a href="radio"&gt;radio&lt;/a&gt; OZ, &lt;a href="Bandung"&gt;Bandung&lt;/a&gt;. Annisa uga tau dadi presenter acara &lt;a href="Bundesliga"&gt;Bundesliga&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="RCTI"&gt;RCTI&lt;/a&gt;. Annisa Pohan iku anak kang kaping pindho saka &lt;a href="Deputi%20Gubernur"&gt;Deputi Gubernur&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Bank%20Indonesia"&gt;BI&lt;/a&gt; kang jenengé &lt;a href="Aulia%20Pohan"&gt;Aulia Pohan&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Kauripan Pribadi</h2>
Kauripan Pribadi.
Annisa Larasati Pohan ya iku anak nomer loro saka sadulur kang cacahé telu. Annisa iku anak saka pasangan &lt;a href="Aulia%20Pohan"&gt;Aulia Pohan&lt;/a&gt; kang asalé saka &lt;a href="Sumatera%20Utara"&gt;Sumatera Utara&lt;/a&gt; lan ibuné jenengé &lt;a href="Mulyaningsih"&gt;Mulyaningsih&lt;/a&gt; kang asalé saka &lt;a href="Jawa%20Timur"&gt;Jawa Timur&lt;/a&gt;. Bapaké ya iku Aulia Pohan ya iku mantan Deputi Gubernur &lt;a href="Bank%20Indonesia"&gt;Bank Indonesia&lt;/a&gt;. Annisa lair ing &lt;a href="Boston"&gt;Boston&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; banjur mèlu bapake kang duwé tugas ing &lt;a href="Tokyo"&gt;Tokyo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jepang"&gt;Jepang&lt;/a&gt; nganti pirang-pirang taun. Sawisé iku Annisa Pohan banjur manggon ing &lt;a href="Jakarta"&gt;Jakarta&lt;/a&gt; wiwit &lt;a href="SD"&gt;SD&lt;/a&gt; nganti lulus saka &lt;a href="SMU%2070%20Bulungan"&gt;SMU 70 Bulungan&lt;/a&gt;. Annisa banjur &lt;a href="kuliyah"&gt;kuliyah&lt;/a&gt; lan éntuk gelar sarjana ékonomi saka &lt;a href="Universitas%20Padjadjaran"&gt;Universitas Padjadjaran&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bandung"&gt;Bandung&lt;/a&gt;.
Pengalamané Annisa Pohan kaya ta dadi &lt;a href="GADIS%20Sampul"&gt;GADIS Sampul&lt;/a&gt; 1997, Gadis Tiara Sunsilk 2001, Penyiar Radio OZ 103.1FM, Bandung, modhél iklan, Presenter Sport &lt;a href="RCTI"&gt;RCTI&lt;/a&gt; ing program &lt;a href="Bundesliga"&gt;Bundesliga&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="La%20Liga"&gt;La Liga&lt;/a&gt;, acara bal-balan lan acara hiburan liyané.
Nalika wiwitan &lt;a href="Juli"&gt;Juli&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2005"&gt;2005&lt;/a&gt;, Annisa Pohan dhaup karo &lt;a href="Agus%20Harimurti%20Yudhoyono"&gt;Agus Harimurti Yudhoyono&lt;/a&gt; salah sijiné perwira &lt;a href="TNI%20AD"&gt;TNI AD&lt;/a&gt; kang uga dadi anak kang sepisanan présidhèn RI kaping 6 &lt;a href="Susilo%20Bambang%20Yudhoyono"&gt;Susilo Bambang Yudhoyono&lt;/a&gt;.
Nalika tanggal &lt;a href="17"&gt;17&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Agustus"&gt;Agustus&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2008"&gt;2008&lt;/a&gt;, ngepasi Hari Kemerdekaan ke-63, Annisa nglairaké bayi wadon kang jenengé &lt;a href="Almira%20Tunggadewi%20Yudhoyono"&gt;Almira Tunggadewi Yudhoyono&lt;/a&gt; sarana &lt;a href="oprasi"&gt;oprasi&lt;/a&gt;.
